   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "JL 261011: \"How do we really think about haipipe-page, it is\nmore like the haipipe-draft, which contains the logic, sentences,\nand evidence, and have a subfolder of draft to work on.\" What\nthe Page skills manage today …",
